#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:3
#: bf39748d1c3a4b93a016723b267e82c4
msgid "Obstacle Generator"
msgstr "障碍物生成器"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:10
#: b3dabace9d9d417297bdcaba5f6c65f7
msgid ""
"Allows the user to send simulated obstacles to ArduPilot, in order to test "
"object avoidance techniques. This module was originally developed for the "
"2018 UAV Outback Challenge."
msgstr ""
"允许用户向 ArduPilot 发送模拟障碍物，以测试避障技术。该模块最初为 2018 年 UAV Outback Challenge 比赛开发。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:13
#: 2ebea94946d749029770f73a9bc0fc32
msgid ""
"When loaded, the user can right-click on the MAVProxy map to drop obstacles."
" These include birds, planes and clouds. These are sent to 127.0.0.1:45454 "
"in ASTERIX format."
msgstr ""
"加载后，用户可在 MAVProxy 地图上右键点击放置障碍物，包括鸟类、飞机和云朵。这些障碍物以 ASTERIX 格式发送至 "
"127.0.0.1:45454。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:16
#: 4c73816505b04938916194f143069837
msgid ""
"The ``asterix`` module will recieve these obstacles from 127.0.0.1:45454 and"
" convert to a ``ADSB_VEHICLE`` MAVLink message and then on-send to "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"``asterix`` 模块将从 127.0.0.1:45454 接收这些障碍物信息，转换为 ``ADSB_VEHICLE`` MAVLink "
"消息后发送给 ArduPilot。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/genobstacles.rst:19
#: 06f0951455fd4d228cc05fd4d96057e5
msgid ""
"If ADSB avoidance is enabled, ArduPilot will then attempt to avoid the "
"object."
msgstr "若启用了 ADSB 避障功能，ArduPilot 将尝试规避该障碍物。"
